[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1435","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1266","title":"BSD rshd 用户名枚举漏洞","description":"rsh守护程序（rshd）存在用户枚举漏洞，当远程攻击者向目标系统提交有效用户名与无效用户名时，守护程序返回不同的错误提示信息，攻击者可通过对比响应差异枚举系统中存在的有效用户账户，为后续暴力破解或针对性攻击提供便利。该漏洞影响所有运行rshd服务的Unix/Linux系统，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。建议禁用rsh服务并改用SSH协议。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1266"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-06-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"禁用 rsh/rlogin 服务，改用 SSH（OpenSSH）替代远程访问。如必须保留 rshd，修改 /etc/hosts.equiv 和 ~/.rhosts 仅允许受信主机，并在 /etc/inetd.conf 中为 rshd 添加 TCP Wrapper 限制，同时配置 syslog 记录所有认证失败日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/6978","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1660"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0095","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0033","title":"Sun Solaris at 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun 系统的 at 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于对用户输入数据长度校验不严，本地攻击者可向 at 程序提交特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 SunOS、UnixWare、Open Desktop、OpenServer 等多个 Unix 操作系统版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。仅需本地账户即可利用，无需认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0033"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-06-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sun Solaris 至 2.5.1 及以上安全补丁版本，或安装 Sun 发布的对应安全补丁（如 105830-xx 系列）。对于 UnixWare/OpenServer 等受影响系统，升级至厂商修复版本。临时缓解措施：移除 at 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/at），或通过编辑 cron.allow/at.allow 文件严格限制可执行 at 命令的用户白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0033"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0197","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0083","title":"SGI IRIX FTP 文件描述符泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统的 FTP 服务中存在文件描述符泄露漏洞，`getcwd()` 函数在处理 FTP 请求时未能正确关闭文件描述符，导致系统文件描述符资源被逐步耗尽。远程攻击者可通过多次发送特定 FTP 命令触发此漏洞，造成 FTP 服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0083"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:32Z","remediation":"建议升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.3 及以上版本（含 SGI 安全补丁 19970701-01-P），修复 FTP 守护进程 getcwd() 文件描述符泄漏问题。如无法升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 FTP 行并重启 inetd 以禁用匿名 FTP，或在网络边界防火墙封禁 TCP 21 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0083"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0461","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0461.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0275","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 DNS Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 DNS 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 UDP 53 端口发送大量超长字符数据包，导致 DNS 服务耗尽系统资源而崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0275"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:03Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 4 或更高版本安全更新，限制仅允许信任源 IP 访问 DNS 服务端口 53，在防火墙层面启用速率限制和连接数控制以缓解 DNS 泛洪攻击。建议升级至 Windows Server 2003 或更高版本以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0275","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0275","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0275.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0275.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0275.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w59j-5972-p7cr/GHSA-w59j-5972-p7cr.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/winnt_dns_flood.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0275.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0461.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0461.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0461.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0372","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0189","title":"Sun Solaris rpcbind 服务远程未授权访问漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统中的 rpcbind 服务默认监听在 UDP 端口 111，同时会动态绑定到其他高位 UDP 端口。由于网络管理员通常仅过滤标准端口 111，而未对高位 UDP 端口实施访问控制策略，导致远程攻击者可绕过防火墙过滤规则直接访问 rpcbind 服务，进而获取系统 RPC 程序信息映射，为后续远程攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响所有使用 rpcbind 的 Solaris 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0189"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:47Z","remediation":"安装 Sun Security Bulletin #142 中对应 Solaris 版本的补丁（覆盖 Solaris 2.3~2.5.1）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制 rpcbind 仅允许 UDP 111 端口通行，并添加规则阻断高位 UDP 端口的入站流量；同时可在 /etc/system 中配置 rpcbind 仅绑定已知端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/142"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1156","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0799","title":"BSD bootpd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"bootpd 是 BOOTP（Bootstrap Protocol）协议服务器程序，2.4.3 及更早版本在处理客户端请求时，对 boot file 位置字段缺乏长度校验，当接收到包含超长路径字符串的请求时会发生缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 bootpd 的系统，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送特制的 BOOTP 请求触发溢出，导致服务崩溃或可能执行任意代码，进而影响网络启动服务的可用性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0799"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"升级 bootpd 至 2.4.4 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出。若无法立即升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中禁用 bootpd 服务，或通过防火墙限制仅允许受信任的 DHCP/BOOTP 客户端网段访问 67/UDP 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0799","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0799.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0799","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0799.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f7f250b0cc5cc23741447612a2f182f04c36db78/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0799.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cvq9-5xpv-rx24/GHSA-cvq9-5xpv-rx24.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0799.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/324/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0468","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0468.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0281","title":"Microsoft IIS 2.0/3.0 URL长路径拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 2.0 及 3.0 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送超长 URL 请求，导致 IIS 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击门槛低，影响运行 IIS 2.0/3.0 的 Windows NT 系统。由于年代久远，微软已停止支持相关版本，建议升级至更高版本 IIS。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0281"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:03Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft IIS 4.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中启用 URL 长度限制（设置 MaxClientRequestBuffer 注册表值为 4096 字节），并在防火墙层面限制对 Web 服务 80/443 端口的异常长 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0281","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20802","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0281.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0281.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0281","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58eef6eedd760f280b47bfb4c94db9995b29c5a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0281.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0281.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0281.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0281.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5a605876-602f-4a7d-96cb-b788c024c2a8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0281.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0468.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0468.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0468.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0413","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0227","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 LSA/LSARPC 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的本地安全认证子系统服务（LSASS.EXE）在处理 LSA/LSARPC 请求时存在访问冲突漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 请求，触发 LSASS.EXE 进程崩溃，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，但无法实现远程代码执行或提权。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0227"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:57Z","remediation":"建议升级至受支持版本的 Windows（Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等），Windows NT 4.0 已终止支持且不再发布安全更新。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上阻止 TCP 135 (RPC) 和 139 (NetBIOS) 端口的入站连接，限制 LSARPC 接口的远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ154087","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0227","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0227.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0227.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0227.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x81000/80917/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--87f50d43-aca9-4ba6-b704-6b3b4ebdaad2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d6641cf4b3c3f049679d3cd7a1e7c74ad9ced77c/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0413.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0294","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0144","title":"Dan Bernstein QMail 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"QMail 1.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 SMTP 协议的 RCPT 命令指定大量收件人地址，导致 QMail 在处理过程中消耗过多系统资源（CPU 与内存），最终造成邮件服务瘫痪。该漏洞影响 Dan Bernstein QMail 1.0 及早期版本，CVSS 评分为 2.1，危害等级低。官方建议升级至 QMail 1.03 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0144"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"升级到 netqmail 1.06 或应用 qmail-1.03 的 RCPT DoS 补丁；在 qmail-smtpd 中设置软限制参数 `MAXRCPTS`（如设为 100），限制单次 SMTP 会话的收件人数量；同时启用 `rcpthosts` 和 `morercpthosts` 控制邮件转发，防止被滥用为拒绝服务攻击的反射点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cr.yp.to/qmail/venema.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319024&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319029&w=2","http://www.ornl.gov/its/archives/mailing-lists/qmail/1997/06/threads.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2237","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/208","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20562","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0144.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0144","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0144.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0144.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0144.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78g5-jc8q-wgq5/GHSA-78g5-jc8q-wgq5.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2237/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0144.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0099","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0035","title":"多厂商 Unix ftpd 信号处理竞态条件漏洞","description":"ftpd 守护进程的信号处理例程中存在条件竞争漏洞（Race Condition），攻击者可利用信号处理时序差绕过文件访问控制，实现任意文件读取或写入。该漏洞影响多个 UNIX 系统中的 ftpd 实现，攻击者需与目标建立 FTP 连接并在特定操作窗口内触发竞态条件以完成利用，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0035"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:24Z","remediation":"升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.5.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了信号处理例程中的条件竞争问题。如无法升级，建议禁用 FTP 服务（systemctl disable vsftpd/wu-ftpd）或替换为 vsftpd/ProFTPD 等更安全的 FTP 守护进程。在不必要的情况下，可通过防火墙限制对 21 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0035"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0090","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0034","title":"Perl suidperl 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"suidperl（sperl）是 Perl 中用于执行 SUID 权限脚本的辅助程序，其在处理用户输入时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向目标系统提交特制的 Perl 脚本参数触发该溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据结构，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Perl 4.x 及 5.x 版本，涉及 BSD/OS、RedHat、SGI 等多个操作系统平台，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0034"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:24Z","remediation":"升级 Perl 至 5.004 或更高版本以修复 suidperl 缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可移除 suidperl 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidperl），并改用 sudo 机制替代 setuid 脚本执行。长期建议彻底废弃 suidperl，使用常规 Perl 解释器配合 sudo 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0034","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19547","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0034","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0034.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0034.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0034.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6v5q-h64v-p5mp/GHSA-6v5q-h64v-p5mp.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/b45d5ed44c1ca4a46a9138ebed1f2bec6deb0956/TO_DO","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0034.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0090.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0090.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1357","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1143","title":"SGI IRIX runtime linker 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.x 及更早版本中的运行时链接器程序 rld 存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过利用 setuid 和 setgid 程序在链接过程中对 rld 进行操纵，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞源于 rld 在处理特权程序时未正确验证调用者身份，导致低权限用户可借助已授权的 setuid/setgid 二进制文件执行任意代码，实现完全控制目标系统。攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限，无需其他认证条件，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1143"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:48Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 19970504-01-PX 中提供的 rld 补丁，升级 IRIX 到包含修复的最新版本。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统；若无法迁移，应限制本地用户对 setuid/setgid 程序的访问权