AIX 多个版本，需要本地用户身份才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0064"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:29Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX APAR IX73924 安全补丁，或升级至 AIX 4.2.1 及以上版本。若无法立即打补丁，可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/lquerylv` 移除该程序的 setuid 位，以阻止本地普通用户通过此漏洞获取 root 权限；同时限制不可信用户的本地访问权限作为深度防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167418428&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/335","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0064.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0064","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0064.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0064.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0064.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqqq-75g7-35v7/GHSA-mqqq-75g7-35v7.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0096","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0036","title":"SGI IRIX login 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.4 及之前版本中的 /bin/login 程序存在本地权限提升漏洞。当 LOCKOUT 参数设置为非零值时，攻击者可通过精心构造的输入触发缓冲区溢出，以 root 权限创建或破坏系统文件，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地 shell 访问权限，利用门槛较低，危害严重。SGI 已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0036"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:25Z","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 1997 年 5 月安全公告 19970508-02-PX 提供的修补补丁。临时缓解措施：在 /etc/default/login 配置文件中将 LOCKOUT 参数设为 0 并重启 login 服务。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止技术支持多年，建议尽快迁移至仍受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/h-106.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/990","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/557","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f47735aa52980ccd9473eed79b62a27c199a2cfa/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/SSVC/data/1999/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0036","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/dcc6735c9c3e50e93de820fa1ac9c54ecf6b2577/1999/CVE-1999-0036.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0036.json","https://github.co